{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7Kdw7oQuV2qT8ruQpDf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before I draft this, a few questions. Your answers would change what the letter says:\n\n1. **Who is the managing partner, and what do they already think of you?** Their name, and whether they were involved in the March deadline error or know about it. Also, are any of the 4 lawyers you support likely to back this request, and could you name one in the letter?\n2. **Is there an open senior paralegal position, or are you asking the firm to create one?** If there's already a senior paralegal in the group, the case changes: you'd be asking for a second one or to replace someone.\n3. **What has happened since the second-person check went in?** For example, no missed or wrong deadlines since last March, or the other two groups adopting the check as well. This is what answers the obvious objection about the error.\n4. **Do you already do any supervising beyond the training?** For example, reviewing the newer paralegals' work, assigning tasks, or covering when someone is out. Senior means supervising, so evidence that you already do it carries the most weight.\n5. **What can you commit to in the role?** For example, a first-90-days plan, rolling the deadline sheet out firm-wide, or a training program for new hires. And do you want a decision by a certain date, such as the annual review cycle?\n6. **Is there anything the partner knows or will learn that the facts above leave out?** For example, a budget freeze, a colleague who also wants the role, or concerns raised in a past review.\n\nIf you don't know some of these, tell me and I'll write without them rather than guess."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":727,"cache_read_input_tokens":9545,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":727},"output_tokens":476,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b9cf1a9b-0d90-4f76-bd26-765993972f93","uuid":"34c9a1cb-0ae5-4f98-859a-06c6b45bf21b","timestamp":"2026-11-16T21:32:24.797Z","request_id":"req_011Ch7Kdvx8V9HXvVbdtrBbC"}
